<div id="side-content-block-52" class="fxb-side-content-block fxb-module background-position-outside mobile-right-on-top always-visible    preset-quick-links">

  <div class="fxb-side-content-block-inner w-100  light-theme bg-transparent-color">

    <div class="container">      <div class="row">
        <div class="fxb-side-content-inner fxb-module-inner layout-contained empty-content-none align-left">
          <div class="fxb-side-content-block-heading rich-text-output ul-default-syle transition-st-sp-slow">
                      </div>
          <div class="fxb-side-content-inner-wrapper d-flex w-100 light-theme bg-transparent-color">
            
              
              <div class="side-content-col layout-width-65 item-left content-items-n-1 bg-position-outside padding-top-None padding-bottom-Triple has-background-color light-theme overlay-type-none no-blend-blocks">

                
                <div class="side-content-item-bg bg-transparent-color" ></div>

                <div class="side-content-item type-text rich-text-output ul-default-syle el-nobmargin-last d-flex flex-column transition-st-sp-slow fz0-vscroll-fx-onview-wonce-st0-end0" > <h2>Fund Overview</h2>
<p>A high conviction global Small/Mid cap (SMID) equity Fund which invests in approx. 35 &#8211; 45 exceptional, Quality/Growth companies globally. </p>
<p>Investing in smaller/mid cap equities often provides investors with attractive growth and diversification benefits compared to large cap global equities.</p>
<p>Smaller companies often have more room to grow when compared to their larger cap peers.  Typically, there are fewer analysts looking at these smaller companies, thereby providing reward to those investors willing to take the time and effort to research the opoportunities.</p>
<p>Our quality investment process focus&#8217; upon profitable, well managed companies with strong balance sheets and attractive growth opportunities.</p>
</div>
              </div>
              
            
              
              <div class="side-content-col layout-width-35 item-right content-items-n-1 bg-position-outside padding-top-None padding-bottom-Triple has-background-color light-theme overlay-type-none no-blend-blocks">

                
                <div class="side-content-item-bg bg-transparent-color" ></div>

                <div class="side-content-item type-text rich-text-output ul-default-syle el-nobmargin-last d-flex flex-column transition-st-sp-slow fz0-vscroll-fx-onview-wonce-st0-end0" > <h3>Quicklinks</h3>
